      "answer": "No. The course does not require identifiable personal information to be published."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is web accessibility?",
      "answer": "Web accessibility means making websites easier for people with different needs to perceive, navigate and use."
    },
    {
      "question": "Will students learn image alt text?",
      "answer": "Yes. Appropriate image descriptions are included in the curriculum."
    },
    {
